  nonce: c4a8  # c4a8
  message: "Reproduced a sibling case 2026-10-16 (docstring audit): the field-chain arm also binds an in-repo method when the field's type is KNOWN EXTERNAL. Temp module: mylog/logger.go declares (*Logger).Info; app/engine.go has type Engine struct{ logger *slog.Logger } and calls e.logger.Info(\"hi\"). analyze_go emits Engine.Run -> go:mylog/logger.go:5-5:Logger.Info:method, meta receiver=typed_field, confidence 0.85. Cause: go.py ~4451-4461 does the bare local/global lookup before the _external_package_for_type check in the elif (~4478-4492). go.py's docstring L64-67 states the intended rule (never looked up in-repo); fix order: external check first, then the package-scoped lookup this item already asks for."  # c4a8
